---
const strip = [
  ['2002', 'Murphy’s Plumbing Services Pty Ltd registered, ABN 24 101 951 759'],
  ['PE 100', 'certified installations, Electrofusion and Butt Welding, plus Vac Operations'],
];
---
<section data-section="builders" aria-labelledby="bld-h2" class="bg-ground border-t border-accent">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-7xl px-5 lg:px-8 py-16 lg:py-24 grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-12">
    <div class="lg:col-span-6">
      <p class="font-medium uppercase tracking-[0.22em] text-xs">For builders and civil contractors</p>
      <h2 id="bld-h2" class="mt-3 font-display text-4xl lg:text-5xl leading-tight">A subcontractor with the plant, the tickets and the crew already in place.</h2>
      <p class="mt-6 text-ink/80">Murphy's Plumbing Services is an industrial plumbing company committed to delivering high-quality, large-scale plumbing solutions for civil infrastructure projects. With a skilled team including licensed plumbers and excavator operators, we offer unmatched expertise in water, sewage, gas, and stormwater systems.</p>
      <p class="mt-4 text-ink/80">Our commitment to excellence is backed by years of experience and the equipment to match. From deep trenching to precise pipe installations, we take pride in tackling challenging projects with professionalism and precision.</p>
    </div>
    <dl class="lg:col-span-5 lg:col-start-8 border-t border-ink">
      {strip.map(([n, d]) => (
        <div class="py-5 border-b border-accent grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-6 items-baseline">
          <dt class="font-display text-5xl lg:text-6xl leading-none">{n}</dt>
          <dd class="text-ink/80">{d}</dd>
        </div>
      ))}
    </dl>
  </div>
</section>
